{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No More Light</strong> is a narrative-driven, post-apocalyptic survival shooter where grotesque insectoid horrors have overrun Earth, and humanity hangs by a thread. You play as a lone survivor, scavenging the ruins of civilization, uncovering buried secrets, and harnessing alien powers in a desperate bid to endure\u2014and possibly strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival is just the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infect the Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain control of insectoid creatures using <strong>Parasite Control</strong>, a unique gameplay mechanic that lets you infiltrate the swarm, solve environmental challenges, and turn enemies against each other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace Metamorphosis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undergo a terrifying transformation as your body fuses with alien biomass. Gain extraordinary abilities\u2014at the cost of your humanity. The line between man and monster begins to blur.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weaponize the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command experimental <strong>HAARP systems</strong> to manipulate the weather in real time. Summon lightning storms, blizzards, and electromagnetic pulses to disrupt alien clusters, expose hidden biomass, or turn the tide in brutal firefights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Alien Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theories were true: <strong>HAARP is active. The Grays are real.</strong> You\u2019ll uncover a story woven with conspiracies, betrayal, and buried knowledge that could decide the future of the planet.<br>Explore desolate environments. Fight overwhelming odds. Scavenge, upgrade, and evolve in a world where every choice shapes your path\u2014and your morality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eerie, Immersive Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a devastated Earth transformed by alien infestation. Explore crumbling cities wrapped in biomass, frozen wastelands scarred by weather experiments, abandoned military bunkers echoing with secrets, and subterranean hives where the swarm thrives. Every biome is handcrafted to immerse you in dread, discovery, and the haunting beauty of a world consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical third-person survival shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, branching story shaped by player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasite-based possession mechanics to infiltrate and control enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, weather-based environmental manipulation via HAARP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades and powers through alien metamorphosis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, handcrafted levels blending sci-fi and horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich world of post-apocalyptic conspiracy and alien influence<br> <br><strong>Will you survive the swarm\u2014or become part of it?</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1363400?t=1776779978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/a821e05197a479b75a08d21a686b604349053023/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776779978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/9d32d12da1ecf028cbefe11ad065e0622edcdf06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776779978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/9d32d12da1ecf028cbefe11ad065e0622edcdf06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776779978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, and Strong Language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No More Light</strong> is a narrative-driven, post-apocalyptic survival shooter where grotesque insectoid horrors have overrun Earth, and humanity hangs by a thread. You play as a lone survivor, scavenging the ruins of civilization, uncovering buried secrets, and harnessing alien powers in a desperate bid to endure\u2014and possibly strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival is just the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infect the Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain control of insectoid creatures using <strong>Parasite Control</strong>, a unique gameplay mechanic that lets you infiltrate the swarm, solve environmental challenges, and turn enemies against each other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c9beb74c507d683fcb3bffa438ea965d.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace Metamorphosis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undergo a terrifying transformation as your body fuses with alien biomass. Gain extraordinary abilities\u2014at the cost of your humanity. The line between man and monster begins to blur.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/c5ac05a8179068f8010f8065ce09163d.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weaponize the Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command experimental <strong>HAARP systems</strong> to manipulate the weather in real time. Summon lightning storms, blizzards, and electromagnetic pulses to disrupt alien clusters, expose hidden biomass, or turn the tide in brutal firefights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/b8da32626404b65ab7ba783db40db2f9.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Alien Conspiracy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theories were true: <strong>HAARP is active. The Grays are real.</strong> You\u2019ll uncover a story woven with conspiracies, betrayal, and buried knowledge that could decide the future of the planet.<br>Explore desolate environments. Fight overwhelming odds. Scavenge, upgrade, and evolve in a world where every choice shapes your path\u2014and your morality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/4a20dc167a08c6413fdeb9d8fee02454.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eerie, Immersive Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a devastated Earth transformed by alien infestation. Explore crumbling cities wrapped in biomass, frozen wastelands scarred by weather experiments, abandoned military bunkers echoing with secrets, and subterranean hives where the swarm thrives. Every biome is handcrafted to immerse you in dread, discovery, and the haunting beauty of a world consumed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.poster.avif?t=1776779978\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.webm?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/extras/3fd963c13de73ac0bf1bf713123983de.mp4?t=1776779978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical third-person survival shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, branching story shaped by player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasite-based possession mechanics to infiltrate and control enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, weather-based environmental manipulation via HAARP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades and powers through alien metamorphosis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, handcrafted levels blending sci-fi and horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich world of post-apocalyptic conspiracy and alien influence<br> <br><strong>Will you survive the swarm\u2014or become part of it?</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Para 51 Games","Invictus"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1363400/8da42825201d3fcea49bccce118e9ef57c6a100d/header.jpg?t=1776779978","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",